This package is an unofficial client of the Firebase Data Connect service (gRPC and REST). Its protocol behaviour follows the Firebase JavaScript, Android and iOS SDKs (https://github.com/firebase/firebase-js-sdk, https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk and https://github.com/firebase/firebase-ios-sdk, Apache License 2.0); the protocol buffer definitions in res/protos come from the Firebase iOS SDK. It is not a port of a Firebase SDK.

lib/src/compat/ (the library package:firebase_data_connect_dart/flutterfire.dart) ports the public API of FlutterFire's firebase_data_connect 0.4.2 (https://github.com/firebase/flutterfire, commit 6a80b1b, Apache License 2.0, copyright Google LLC): lib/src/optional.dart, lib/src/timestamp.dart, lib/src/any_value.dart, lib/src/core/empty_serializer.dart, lib/src/common/dataconnect_error.dart, lib/src/common/dataconnect_options.dart, and the value types of lib/src/cache/cache_data_types.dart and lib/src/core/ref.dart.

